{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/r65zt8","slide":1,"text":"Focus on the current fine-tuned model. The strongest result is LORO ESN (R² 0.771). The most important improvement is LOMO ESN: R² increases by 0.0908 and NRMSE decreases by 9.2%, indicating better generalization to unseen materials. LOTO remains the main limitation because the model still does not transfer reliably to a completely unseen temperature.\n\n[Sources]\n- User-provided model-performance table (XGBoost update 2 and fine-tuned current update)."}